(text "8 bidirectional parallel ports: D0..D7 on pins 1..8, GND on pins 9/10\nOnly one external tri-state writer may be enabled at a time\nU1 drives the LEDs; it never drives the bus\nJ9: +5V / GND; data ports do not carry power\nSW1 ON enables bit LEDs; OFF pulls OE_n high through 10k; PWR stays on" (at 140 178 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 89c7c2ce-ed4e-4f6c-9728-63da154c0862))
